  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "Session-level quality grades for FEV1 and FVC as defined in Table 10 of the ATS/ERS 2019 technical standard\n(Graham BL et al., Standardization of Spirometry 2019 Update, Am J Respir Crit Care Med 2019;200(8):e70-e88).\nThe repeatability thresholds below apply to patients older than 6 years. FEV1 and FVC are graded independently."] ;
